    },
    {
      "message_id": 4,
      "session_id": "rec-s02-20261106T1219Z",
      "user_id": "rec-u02",
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Evidence: `prash/circuit_breaker.py:L40-L100`. - [implemented] The audit log appends one JSON object per line and is never rewritten in place. [1] Module: `prash.audit`. - Docstring summary: Append-only audit log of every action Prash takes. - Classes: `AuditLog` (object) `prash/audit.py:L27-L90`. - Imported by tests: `tests/test_audit.py`, `tests/test_desktop_api.py`. [3] Values are never echoed to the console or audit log — only key names are. - Capabilities: `('get_secret_keys', 'update_secret')`. [4]",
      "status": "GROUNDED",
      "query_id": "q-2e7b3d1a9a23",
      "tokens": 128,
      "created_at": 1793967621.26528,
      "citations": [
